      "instruction": "Retrieve visual evidence that strictly satisfies the query, including negation. For safety-helmet queries, inspect visible heads and distinguish a safety helmet from exposed hair or scalp. Construction scenery and safety vests alone do not satisfy a helmet condition. If the query asks for a person without a safety helmet, at least one clearly visible head must lack a safety helmet; an obscured head is not sufficient evidence. If it asks for a person wearing a safety helmet, at least one visible person must wear one. Judge visible appearance, not legal requirements."
